### GET joke
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/01/joke

### GET three jokes in one call
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/02/client/threeJokes

### Get a joke about AI
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/03/joke?topic="AI"

### Get a list of shakespere plays
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/04/plays/list

### Get a list of objects of the plays of shakesphere
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/04/plays/object

### Get the current time in a city
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/time?city="Istanbul"

### Get what day of the week is tomorrow in a city
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/dayOfWeek?city="Barcelona, Spain"

### Get the Weather in Toronto
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/weather

### Get a packing list for a trip to Toronto
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/pack

### Get a packing list for a trip to Paris
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/pack?city="paris and Toronto"

### find an italian resturant for lunch
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/search

### find an indian resturant
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/search?query="I am looking for Indian dinner tonight in Toronto"

### find an indian resturant
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/05/search?query="I am looking for tapas lunch  next Tuesday for 2"


### Ask a question about fruits
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/06/fruit

### Ask a question about vegtables
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/06/veg

### Ask a question about an image
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/07/explain

### Write an essay in streaming mode
# curl -N GET http://localhost:8080/chat/08/essay
# http --stream :8080/chat/08/essay
# without streaming http :8080/chat/08/essay
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/08/essay
Accept: text/event-stream


### ToolCallAdvisor — tool runs inside the model (default Spring AI 1.x behaviour)
GET http://localhost:8080/advisor/04/internal?q=What+time+is+it+in+Tokyo

### ToolCallAdvisor — tool runs in the advisor chain (new in Spring AI 2.0)
GET http://localhost:8080/advisor/04/advisor-chain?q=What+time+is+it+in+Tokyo

### JDBC chat memory — persists across restarts (new in Spring AI 2.0, requires pgvector profile)
GET http://localhost:8080/mem/04/chat?message=Hi+my+name+is+Bob&sessionId=test1

### JDBC chat memory — verify persistence (restart app, then query)
GET http://localhost:8080/mem/04/chat?message=What+is+my+name?&sessionId=test1

### Dynamic tool search — all tools sent to model (baseline)
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/09/all?q=What+time+is+it+in+Berlin

### Dynamic tool search — relevant tools only forwarded (new in Spring AI 2.0)
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/09/smart?q=What+time+is+it+in+Berlin
